{"ID":"20240513083036-wssxt21","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083036-wssxt21","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083036-wssxt21\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170001-ia47p30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170001-ia47p30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:535,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170001-ia47p30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:933,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:944\u0026#125;","title":"269","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513170001-ia47p30","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 873px;","id":"20240513170001-ia47p30","updated":"20240515115622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/19"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"207 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"68歲 微胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.1999年被檢察出肺癌，開刀切除右下肺。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2000年雙肺有lesion，作biopsy切片檢查。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.之後做chemotherapy，掉髮。之後又做radiation Therapy， 病得很厲害。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.2001年又發現幾個腫瘤在肺部。作過化療，腫瘤又長大。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.又吃Tarceva【Target drug】試藥兩年，11月前停止。開始有縮小，現又長回"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠 :不能通霄睡眠。無固定時醒來。並非在3:00~5:00醒來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 呼吸很淺，坐起來舒服，稍微不能平躺。有時還用氧氣呼吸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 用過 inhalter—steroid類固醇吸入器。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 大便:好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 胃口:過好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 無胸痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 咳嗽偶爾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 多數時身體覺得熱。Outside"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→熱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，inside"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、 腳:冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、 口渴:有。喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、 身體:易寒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃乾"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瞳孔反應無；肝區鬆散；脾區小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→故胃口過好是類固醇造成的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；眼白區很多血絲，還有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小黃痰塊，中間有白點。→肺癌之兆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、耳診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左下肺點壓痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺家陰實。腎陽不足，脾為假陽。肝損。肺中積濕。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳中壓痛點。眼診肺區痰飲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 十棗湯__8粒。紅棗粉一包。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏 四兩 知母五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃三錢 射干三錢  紫苑三錢 冬花三錢 乾薑二錢 生薑二片"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏四錢 五味子三錢 枳實三錢 丹皮三錢 桃仁三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"補骨酯五錢 澤瀉五錢 細辛二錢 旋覆花三錢 代赭石三錢       "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 帖 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（一） 第一劑藥用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治療肺積濕痰飲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，Fluid 積濕上焦，病人不能平躺。食後要服食白麵湯，煮得很稠，不可加調味料，以補其肺胃津液。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（二） 吐完痰飲後"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病人好轉成"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"射干麻黃湯證。射干麻黃湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"專門治療寒飲，  肺中有水氣，呼吸呼嚕呼嚕聲。有時像水雞聲。此種水氣寒飲，  較"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"之溢飲輕很多。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（三） 病人腎陽不足，用補骨脂滋腎陰、細辛補下焦小腸火、澤瀉利尿，減輕腎負擔。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（四） 旋覆花、代赭石"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治療胃酸逆流"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（五） 丹皮、桃仁"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"活血化瘀(患者眼白肺區充血)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（六） 石膏、知母"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口過好，脾為假陽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td"}]}]}]}